  "id": 203985279359031,
  "uuid": "72f5b09c-1068-4228-88c7-86f6af503809",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "1e81aa4a-250a-740e-2ad1-4f410197cc86",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "611dc2c3-489c-b90a-b3bc-9c898da68130",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "A signing ceremony was held to formalize and commemorate the gift. Dr Hasnain Zafar, a distinguished class alumnus and AKU faculty member signed the agreement on behalf the Class of '91 while Dr Adil Haider, Dean at the Medical College, Pakistan represented the University. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "This reinforces the commitment of AKU alumni to the shared vision for the advancement of healthcare and education at AKU. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"We are grateful for our alumni's unwavering support! This contribution reinforces our shared vision for healthcare and education advancement,\" said Dean Haider.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The Medical College in Pakistan celebrates 40 years since it's establishment. It aims to produce responsible healthcare professionals who are not only contributing members of society but go on to become the next generation of leaders in their field of choice.  ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Thank you to all our donors from the Class of '91!",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
